msgid "S_GAMEOVER_TIMES_UP"
msgstr "You did not fix the generator in time."

msgid "S_JOHN_CROW"
msgstr "John Crow"

msgid "S_ANDREW_WHITE"
msgstr "Andrew White"

msgid "S_TASK_1"
msgstr "Go to the warehouse hallway and look for a keycard."

msgid "S_TASK_2"
msgstr "Find D-5274, who cleaned this room yesterday."

msgid "S_TASK_3"
msgstr "Go to SCP-347 to ask for a keycard."

msgid "S_TASK_4"
msgstr "Go to Andrew White in SCP-079 containment chamber."

msgid "S_TASK_5"
msgstr "Go to SCP-173 containment chamber to pick up the lost keycard."

msgid "S_TASK_6"
msgstr "Go to generator room in Storage Zone."

msgid "S_TASK_7"
msgstr "Toggle the lever."

msgid "S_TASK_8"
msgstr "Find SCP-181."

msgid "S_TASK_9_SH"
msgstr "Take SCP-347 and some SCP items."

msgid "S_TASK_10_SH"
msgstr "Escape from SCP Foundation."

msgid "S_INTRO_DLG_1"
msgstr "...deep in Site-19 of SCP Foundation"

msgid "S_INTRO_DLG_2"
msgstr "no one Group of Interest tried to attack the facility..."

msgid "S_INTRO_DLG_3"
msgstr "There also were no containment breaches recently..."

msgid "S_INTRO_DLG_4"
msgstr "- You, the major scientist Janusz Krzystofski thought."

msgid "S_INTRO_DLG_5"
msgstr ""
"But today, you found a letter. It was from John Crow -\n"
"the Mobile Task Force \"Nine-Tailed Fox\" agent, who you\n"
"knew as a good colleague."

msgid "S_INTRO_DLG_6"
msgstr ""
"Mobile Task Epsilon-11 \"Nine-Tailed Fox\" did not meet\n"
"this place long ago because no incidents were happening.\n"
"You opened the letter and started reading:"

msgid "S_INTRO_DLG_7"
msgstr "Hello, Janusz."

msgid "S_INTRO_DLG_8"
msgstr "We found unauthorized attack on facility generator in Storage Zone."

msgid "S_INTRO_DLG_9"
msgstr ""
"The power is now supplied from a backup generator,\n"
"but the problem is that its supply is not very large."

msgid "S_INTRO_DLG_10"
msgstr ""
"If energy will run out, the facility will black out, and\n"
"multiple containment breaches will happen."

msgid "S_INTRO_DLG_11"
msgstr ""
"Our experts have calculated that the\n"
"backup generator's supply will only last for 5 days."

msgid "S_INTRO_DLG_12"
msgstr "I recommend to hurry up."

msgid "S_INTRO_DLG_13"
msgstr ""
"You remembered, that keycard should be in the warehouse in Maintenance Zone. "
"What's happened here?"

msgid "S_KEYNOTFOUND_DLG_1"
msgstr "I was sure the keycard was here!"

msgid "S_KEYNOTFOUND_DLG_2"
msgstr "And where keycard is now..."

msgid "S_CLASSD_DLG_1"
msgstr "YOU - Class-D-5274, say immediately where is the key!"

msgid "S_CLASSD_DLG_2"
msgstr "I saw you cleaned that place yesterday!"

msgid "S_CLASSD_DLG_3"
msgstr "...b-but I didn’t see any keys there, maybe they weren’t there?"

msgid "S_CLASSD_DLG_4"
msgstr "Stop pretend like an idiot, or I will send you to 939."

msgid "S_CLASSD_DLG_5"
msgstr "...Oh, I remember, there was a keycard, but yesterday it was missing."

msgid "S_CLASSD_DLG_6"
msgstr "Maybe object 347 stole it?"

msgid "S_347_SCP_DLG_1"
msgstr "Good morning, 347."

msgid "S_347_SCP_DLG_2"
msgstr "Please, call me Claudia!"

msgid "S_347_SCP_DLG_3"
msgstr ""
"Claudia, I really need keycards from generator room.\n"
"Do you know about them?"

msgid "S_347_SCP_DLG_4"
msgstr ""
"I was not here sometime ago, only Dr. Andrew White talked to me yesterday."

msgid "S_347_SCP_DLG_5"
msgstr "Maybe he knows, where is your keycard."

msgid "S_WHITE_SCP_DLG_1"
msgstr "Good morning, Dr. White."

msgid "S_WHITE_SCP_DLG_2"
msgstr ""
"We are in trouble - the main generator is broken,\n"
"only backup generator is working, but it's supply is low..."

msgid "S_WHITE_SCP_DLG_3"
msgstr "I know your problem."

msgid "S_WHITE_SCP_DLG_4"
msgstr ""
"SCP-181 breached from Class-D personnel chamber.\n"
"I saw him on cameras."

msgid "S_WHITE_SCP_DLG_5"
msgstr ""
"He throwed that keycard to SCP-173 containment chamber.\n"
"I was about to go to you with that news."

msgid "S_WHITE_SCP_DLG_6"
msgstr ""
"I need to take some spare Class-D's to safely take from SCP-173's chamber a "
"keycard."

msgid "S_WHERE_IS_181"
msgstr "The main generator is on, but where is SCP-181?"

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_1"
msgstr "Stop right there, 181!"

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_2"
msgstr "Ha-ha-ha, you cannot stop me, Krzystofski!"

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_3"
msgstr ""
"You knew, that it is forbidden to put any biological material\n"
"into SCP-914, but what to do, if SCP-181 was here...\n"
"While you are thinking, what to do, Dr.Andrew White called you."

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_4"
msgstr "Do you want to evade this problem?"

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_4_SH"
msgstr "OK, but I do not understand you."

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_4_SCP"
msgstr "No, thank you."

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_SCP_1"
msgstr ""
"As you like. I wanted to help you, because you were the most sane person in "
"there."

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_SCP_2"
msgstr "I really hope, that you will not be demoted to Class-D after all."

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_5"
msgstr "How much do you know about me?"

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_6"
msgstr "I think, a lot, since we were working many years..."

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_7"
msgstr "I want to surprise you - I am not, who you know."

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_8"
msgstr "Did you think, that SCPs exist here, like in a prison?"

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_9"
msgstr "We think, that they should be free."

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_10"
msgstr ""
"You are cheating people by keeping the unique artifacts\n"
"and creatures behind the wall of secret."

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_11"
msgstr ""
"I recommend that you do not make a fuss about this event.\n"
"Consider this: if your involvement is revealed,\n"
"you could be demoted back to junior researcher, or even to Class-D (for "
"unauthorized use of SCP-914 by Class-D personnel),\n"
"with all the consequences.\n"
"Is that really what you want? Wouldn't it be easier to forget everything and "
"remain the respected major scientist of such an important facility?"

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_12"
msgstr ""
"Think about it, and we'll be happy if you join us,\n"
"or at least don't get in our way."

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_13"
msgstr ""
"Wait, Dr. White, so you've been an agent of the Serpent's Hand all this time?"

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_14"
msgstr ""
"Well, don't jump to conclusions.\n"
"You don't even know who I really am."

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_15"
msgstr ""
"Or maybe you want to be demoted to Class-D,\n"
"and be feeded with amnestics?"

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_16"
msgstr "No, I don't want this."

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_17"
msgstr "Now, think about whether it's worth being in position of Jailor."

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_18"
msgstr ""
"It seems that your position is not bad at first glance - major scientist."

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_19"
msgstr "But with one disadvantage - this scientist works in a jail."

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_20"
msgstr ""
"The only good thing is you don't trying to destroy so-called SCPs, as the "
"Bookburners do."

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_21"
msgstr "Is your conscience silent?"

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_22"
msgstr "My conscience is none of your business."

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_23"
msgstr "I suggest you to get rid of this burden and join us!"

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_23_SCP"
msgstr "I'll stay with SCP Foundation."

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_23_SH"
msgstr "I think, you're right."

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_SH_1"
msgstr "But what will do SCP Foundation with me, after this?"

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_SH_2"
msgstr ""
"None of your business.\n"
"SCP Foundation won't take you from us."

msgid "S_THERE_IS_181_914_SH_3"
msgstr ""
"Here is first your mission - take as many artifacts, as you can.\n"
"A-and Claudia, which you call 347, is important to us."

msgid "S_347_SH_DLG_1"
msgstr "Good morning, Claudia."

msgid "S_347_SH_DLG_2"
msgstr "Dr. White wanted you to go with us."

msgid "S_347_SH_DLG_3"
msgstr "He told you our mission? That's excellent!"

msgid "S_FINAL_SH_DLG_1"
msgstr ""
"Let's go to the exit. I'll create portal to our home dimension,\n"
"and we'll be safe!"

msgid "S_FINAL_SH_DLG_2"
msgstr "To the Wanderer's Library?"

msgid "S_FINAL_SH_DLG_3"
msgstr "Of course."

msgid "S_SCP_FOUNDATION_WIN"
msgstr ""
"You got reprimand, but, luckily, you were not demoted to Class-D personnel.\n"
"SCP-347 and Dr. █████ went missing. Possibly they joined [REDACTED], but "
"information is not approved.\n"
"\n"
"SCP Foundation.\n"
"We secure. We contain. We protect."

msgid "S_SERPENTS_HAND_WIN"
msgstr ""
"After Dr. Andrew White took you to the Wanderer's Library, he takes of a hat "
"(looks like a missing SCP-268) and... is actually a woman.\n"
"She takes you to some bookshelf with Jailor's news, and there was a "
"message:\n"
"\n"
"Multiple containment breach occurred in Site-19,\n"
"SCP-███, SCP-███, SCP-████, SCP-347, Dr. [REDACTED], Dr. [REDACTED] are "
"missing,\n"
"due to attack of [DATA EXPUNGED].\n"
"\n"
"And then, she closed the newspaper, and said you:\n"
"We are safe.\n"
"The Garden is the Serpent's place.\n"
"\n"
"We are the Serpent's Hand."

msgid "S_DELETE_SAVE"
msgstr ""
"Delete save and exit\n"
"(THIS RESETS YOUR\n"
"GAME PROGRESS in case\n"
"of impassability)"
